      "exposure": "Division school facility ban applies to schools, gender-affirming care for minors is banned, and a 2022 sports law and 2024 dormitory rule restrict transgender students. A national order sought criminal investigation of teachers facilitating social transition, including names/pronouns.",
      "protection": "Division prohibits conversion therapy for minors, though clergy, religious counsellors and parents/grandparents are exempt unless acting as psychologists; anti-bullying law has existed since 2006.",
      "interaction": "A travelling minor therefore faces school- and government-building facility exclusion, sports/dorm restrictions, and care denial, while a parent has no documented visitor remedy.",
      "status": "documented"
    },
