      "exposure": "The complaint/reporting system invites reports of transgender people in restrooms and changing rooms, and civil-liberties opposition warns of discriminatory enforcement. No division-specific violence rate was located.",
      "protection": "Division hate-crime law amended in 2019 covers gender identity with enhanced penalties and requires statistics collection; national hate-crime law also covers gender identity.",
      "interaction": "Formal recourse exists for bias violence, but the facility-reporting mechanism makes ordinary privacy-space use itself a complaint risk.",
      "status": "uncertain"
    },
