      "exposure": "No data are provided on facility-complaint numbers or outcomes, and it is unresolved whether a visitor with foreign documents can meet the documentary defence or how state marker rules interact with national entry rules.",
      "protection": "Civil-liberties litigation over passports and challenges to executive orders are unresolved; several orders are blocked or enjoined.",
      "interaction": "Unresolved litigation does not restore facility access or prevent entry refusal while restrictive measures operate.",
      "status": "uncertain"
